Third-party software
--------------------
Runtime bottles (Node.js, git, ripgrep, CLI tools, etc.) are separate programs installed at
runtime under `/data/local/tmp/aiaio/`. They are not linked into this application. Each bottle
records its own license and redistribution status in `tools/bottles/manifest.schema.json`
metadata; see `docs/adr/0005-distribution-and-bottles.md`.
